WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.087
The anchor selects top-level employees with no manager.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:14.172
The recursive term joins employees to the current organization result when an employee's manager I D matches a current

00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:16.782
employee I D. Depth increases by one.

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:19.782
Path appends the employee name.

00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:24.563
Run the query and inspect how the hierarchy expands level by level.
